graph TD
    subgraph "Capstone Project Development Flow"
        direction TB
        START["1. Choose Your Project
Ideas: Text analyzer, data sorter,
file processor, mini-database,
encryption tool, or your own idea!"]
        
        DESIGN["2. Design (design-document.md)
- What data structures?
- What functions?
- What files?
- Draw the architecture
        
plan BEFORE coding!"]
        
        IMPLEMENT["3. Implement (implementation.md)
- Write code section by section
- Compile OFTEN (every 5-10 lines)
- Fix warnings AS THEY APPEAR
- Use git for version control"]
        
        TEST["4. Test (testing-debugging.md)
- Test each function individually
- Test edge cases (empty files, big data)
- Use valgrind (no memory leaks!)
- Fix all bugs before moving on"]
        
        PRESENT["5. Present (presentation.md)
- Show it working
- Explain what you built
- What was hardest?
- What would you add?"]
    end
    
    START --> DESIGN
    DESIGN --> IMPLEMENT
    IMPLEMENT --> TEST
    TEST -->|"Bugs found"| IMPLEMENT
    TEST -->|"All passing"| PRESENT
    
    RULES["GOLDEN RULES:
- Compile EVERY 5 lines
- Test BEFORE moving on
- No memory leaks allowed
- If stuck: DRAW it on paper first"]
    
    style DESIGN fill:#e6f3ff,stroke:#0066cc,stroke-width:2px
    style TEST fill:#e6ffe6,stroke:#00cc00,stroke-width:2px
    style PRESENT fill:#ffffe6,stroke:#cccc00
    style RULES fill:#ffe6e6,stroke:#cc0000,stroke-dasharray:5 5
